0..76 Comment "// A seat\'s protocol evolved: session subtyping as a flow and equi-recursive"
77..153 Comment "// unfolding as a path (Gay and Hole, _Subtyping for Session Types in the Pi"
154..229 Comment "// Calculus_, doi:10.1007/s00236-005-0177-z). A protocol that adds a choice"
230..304 Comment "// the seat may take is a supertype, so a recorded run of the old protocol"
305..382 Comment "// rides forward to the new one; a run that takes the new choice is no run of"
383..394 Comment "// the old."
396..436 Comment "// The seat\'s protocol and its messages."
